  ('f498449e-5735-4608-a796-1b9fddaa2939', 'aparna-serenity', 'Aparna Serenity', 'Aparna Constructions', 'Kompally', 'Hyderabad', '2, 2.5, 3 & 4 BHK Luxury Residences (1,335 - 2,730 Sq.Ft.)', ARRAY[2,3,4]::int[], 'Apartment', '₹1.10 Cr – ₹2.50 Cr+', 11000000, 25000000, 'Ready to Move', 'Ready to Move', '22.45 Acres · 22 Towers (G+9 Mid-Rise) · 80% Open Greens · Zero Common Walls · Dual Clubhouses (50,290 Sft)', 'Aparna Serenity is an expansive, ready-to-move-in luxury residential community crafted by Aparna Constructions in Brundavan Colony, Kompally, North Hyderabad. Spread across 22.45 acres, the project stands out for combining mid-rise, low-density living (G+9 floors across 22 towers) with resort-scale lifestyle infrastructure. Registered under TS RERA No. P02200002386, the community houses 1,499 apartments and is already a thriving, occupied neighborhood with select primary inventory and active resale units available.', ARRAY['Club Serenity – 34,700 Sq.Ft. Grand Clubhouse','Dedicated Sports Complex – 15,590 Sq.Ft. Facility','Zero Common Walls – Acoustically Isolated Units','80% Open Green Space & Urban Forest Grounds','Monolithic Mivan Formwork Construction','All-Weather Temperature-Controlled Indoor Pool','Modern Gym, Aerobics & Wooden Yoga Studio','Squash Court & Indoor Wooden Badminton Courts','Outdoor Floodlit Tennis & Basketball Courts','Synthetic Soccer Turf & Cricket Practice Nets','Commercial Plaza with Supermarket, Pharmacy & ATM','Professionally Managed Crèche & Daycare Center','Dedicated Fenced Pet Park with Agility Lawns','Open-Air Amphitheater for Cultural Events','Water Softening Plant (WSP) & STP Recycled Water','Prepaid Centralized Piped LPG Gas Supply','24/7 Multi-Tier Security with Solar Fencing & CCTV']::text[], '[{"q":"What is Aparna Serenity and who is the developer?","a":"Aparna Serenity is an expansive 22.45-acre ready-to-move luxury gated community crafted by Aparna Constructions in Brundavan Colony, Kompally, North Hyderabad. It features mid-rise, low-density living across 22 towers (G+9 floors) with 1,499 apartments and 80% open green landscapes."},{"q":"Is Aparna Serenity TS RERA registered?","a":"Yes, Aparna Serenity is fully registered under Telangana RERA with TS RERA Registration No. P02200002386."},{"q":"What configurations and sizes are available at Aparna Serenity?","a":"Aparna Serenity offers 2 BHK (1,335 - 1,525 sq.ft.), 2.5 & 3 BHK (1,525 - 2,230 sq.ft.), and 4 BHK (2,639 - 2,730 sq.ft.) luxury residences. Larger 3 BHK and 4 BHK layouts also feature a dedicated maid/utility room."},{"q":"What is the price range and indicative rate per sq.ft.?","a":"Indicative market prices range from ₹1.10 Cr - ₹1.36 Cr for 2 BHK, ₹1.48 Cr - ₹2.25 Cr for 2.5 & 3 BHK, and ₹2.20 Cr - ₹2.50 Cr+ for 4 BHK (~₹9,650+ per sq.ft.). Pricing varies by tower position, floor rise, facing, and interior woodwork."},{"q":"What are the key lifestyle amenities provided?","a":"Amenities are split into two grand hubs totaling over 50,290 sq.ft.: Club Serenity (34,700 sq.ft.) with restaurant, cafe, preview theater, spa/jacuzzi, banquet hall, and guest suites; and a Dedicated Sports Complex (15,590 sq.ft.) with indoor pool, gym, squash, badminton, tennis, soccer turf, crèche, pet park, and on-site commercial plaza."},{"q":"What are the monthly maintenance charges?","a":"Monthly maintenance runs at approximately ₹4.50 per sq.ft., covering 24/7 security, dual-hub clubhouse operations, 80% landscape upkeep, and water treatment plants."}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['/og-aparna-serenity.jpg']::text[], '/og-aparna-serenity.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps?q=Aparna+Serenity+Kompally+Hyderabad&output=embed', 'Aparna Serenity Kompally Hyderabad | Ready to Move 2, 3 & 4 BHK Flats', 'Aparna Serenity in Kompally, Hyderabad by Aparna Constructions. 22.45-acre luxury township with 80% open space, zero common walls, dual clubhouses & ready-to-move homes. Get price sheet & resale list.', 'https://www.naani.in/projects/aparna-serenity', '/projects/aparna-serenity', true, 'published', NULL, '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', 'internal', '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', '2026-11-21T11:12:35.466Z'),
