  ('abefb90a-163f-45ad-99b5-b19dc1ea8de9', 'vasavi-atlantis', 'Vasavi Atlantis', 'Vasavi Group', 'Narsingi', 'Hyderabad', '2, 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK Ultra-High-Rise Residences (1,250 - 3,330 Sq.Ft.)', ARRAY[2,3,4]::int[], 'Apartment', '₹1.06 Cr – ₹3.16 Cr', 10600000, 31600000, 'Under Construction', '2028-08', '12.3 Acres · 8 Towers (40-45 Floors) · Rare Twin Clubhouses · ~70% Open Space · Adjacent to ORR · Near Financial District', 'Vasavi Atlantis is a large-scale, ultra-high-rise luxury gated community developed by Vasavi Group (Vasavi Constructions LLP) in Narsingi, Hyderabad, positioned right off the Nehru Outer Ring Road (ORR) near the Financial District. Spanning 12 to 12.3 acres, the development comprises 8 residential towers rising between 40 and 45 floors (with select sky-villa configurations reaching up to 49 floors) and houses approximately 2,160 to 2,199 apartments across 2, 3, 3.5, and 4 BHK layouts. Registered under TG RERA ID P02400003398, the community reserves ~70% of its footprint for open spaces, landscaped water features, and twin clubhouses.', ARRAY['Rare Twin-Clubhouse Architecture (North & South Wellness Hubs)','Temperature-Controlled Indoor Swimming Pool & Resort Outdoor Pool','Multiple High-Tech Gymnasiums & Aerobics/Yoga Pavilions','Indoor Badminton & International Squash Courts','Lakefront Viewing Promenade & Central Water Bodies with Pedestrian Bridges','Dedicated Business Center, Conference Rooms & Co-Working Lounges','Grand Banquet Hall & Open Party Celebration Lawns','Open-Air Amphitheatre & Private Acoustic Mini-Theatre','4 Basement Parking Levels with Dedicated EV Charging Stations','100% DG Power Backup & Piped Natural Gas Infrastructure','Dedicated Fenced Pet Walk Arena & Children Play Parks','Multipurpose Outdoor Sports Courts (Basketball, Tennis & Skating Rink)','24/7 Smart Security with Automated Boom Barriers & RFID Access']::text[], '[{"q":"What is Vasavi Atlantis and who is the developer?","a":"Vasavi Atlantis is an ultra-high-rise luxury gated community developed by Vasavi Group (Vasavi Constructions LLP) in Narsingi, Hyderabad, located adjacent to the Nehru Outer Ring Road (ORR) near the Financial District. It spans 12.3 acres with 8 towers (40 to 45 floors) and ~2,199 apartments."},{"q":"Is Vasavi Atlantis TG RERA approved?","a":"Yes, Vasavi Atlantis is registered with Telangana RERA under registration ID TG RERA P02400003398."},{"q":"What is the expected possession and handover schedule?","a":"The project was launched in late 2021 with phased handovers scheduled through August 2028."},{"q":"What configurations and apartment sizes are available?","a":"Vasavi Atlantis offers 2 BHK (1,250 – 1,310 sq. ft.), 3 BHK (1,610 – 2,220 sq. ft.), and 3.5 & 4 BHK (2,450 – 3,330 sq. ft.) spacious layouts with large balconies and utility spaces."},{"q":"What is the price range and base per sq. ft. rate?","a":"Current market base rates range from ₹7,700 to ₹9,500 per sq. ft. Unit ticket sizes track from ₹1.06 Cr – ₹1.25 Cr for 2 BHK, ₹1.52 Cr – ₹2.10 Cr for 3 BHK, and ₹2.30 Cr – ₹3.16 Cr+ for 3.5 & 4 BHK, subject to floor rise, PLC, and statutory charges."},{"q":"What are the key lifestyle amenities provided?","a":"The project features a rare twin-clubhouse model across North and South hubs, heated indoor pool, outdoor pool, lakefront deck, co-working business center, 4 basement parking levels with EV chargers, banquet halls, and 50+ sports & recreational amenities."}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['/og-vasavi-atlantis.jpg']::text[], '/og-vasavi-atlantis.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps?q=Vasavi+Atlantis+Narsingi+Hyderabad&output=embed', 'Vasavi Atlantis Narsingi Hyderabad | Luxury 2, 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK High-Rise Apartments', 'Vasavi Atlantis in Narsingi, Hyderabad, off ORR near Financial District. 12.3 acres, 8 towers (40-45 floors), twin clubhouses, 70% open green space, RERA P02400003398. Get pricing & floor plans.', 'https://www.naani.in/projects/vasavi-atlantis', '/projects/vasavi-atlantis', true, 'published', NULL, '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', 'internal', '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', '2026-11-21T11:12:35.469Z'),
